            "review_text": "Milan S\nBangkok, Thailand45 contributions\n0\nThe worst experience in Vietnam after 20 years of travel in the country\nDec 2018 • Family\nTruly the worst service ever in Vietnam as well as the worst food. Vietnam is generally well known for surprisingly good culinary experience and having extensively traveled in this marvelous country the food quality has been improved from year to year. This restaurant is quite full on daily basis with the working crowd going to have drinks and something to eat before heading home later in the evening. The noise level is extremely high and service is most inadequate and disorganized. I would never recommend this place in any respect.\nRead more\nWritten December 17, 2018",
