            "review_text": "Sofi NS\nAthens, Greece28061 contributions\n0\ntypical vietnamese restaurant\nSep 2017 • Couples\nThis a typical Vietnamese restaurant with open area, low tables and local food. The decoration is oriented to American Indian themes (!).\nNot so cheap as you might expect for the local standards, we ended up paying 3m dong for a party of 8, which equals about 16USD per person.\nThe servings is primarily seafood and vegetarian stuff and they provide a wet napkin to clean your fingers while cleaning the shrimps. It is situated behind the reunification palace.\nSuitable for large parties of people,\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 21, 2017",
